      "patient_response": "Well, I guess I'm here because I just can't seem to stop starting things. It's like... I launch all these projects all at once. Work plans for my team, schedules for new IT certifications, completely overhauling my home network, sending out messages to old contacts I haven't spoken to in years. It just gets so intense. I blow right past normal limits, working all hours, until my wife or my director at work has to actually step in and tell me to stop.",
